post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'

nsh is installed. For documentation and guides, see:
  https://github.com/longbridge/nsh

Key commands:
  nsh init <app>       Create a new app
  nsh run <app>        Run app in development
  nsh build <app>      Build app for distribution
  nsh package <app>    Package installable app
  nsh component list   List available runtimes (gpui, tui, web)
  nsh component add <name>  Add a runtime

The web, GPUI, and TUI runtimes are installed under /usr/lib/nsh/runtime/.
Linux host and app runtimes are at /usr/bin/nsh-linux-host and /usr/bin/nsh-linux-app.

EOF
}
